message: "If you use this analysis or the working paper, please cite it as below."
title: "Access Without Depth: Financial Inclusion 2011-2024 and Aggregation Pitfalls in the Global Findex Database 2025"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bykov"
    given-names: "Georgy"
date-released: 2026-07-06
type: article
url: "https://github.com/grgbkv/financial-inclusion-findex-2025"
abstract: >-
  Balanced-panel trends in financial access, usage and resilience from the
  Global Findex Database 2025, together with a quantified taxonomy of four
  aggregation pitfalls in the database's country file and a validation-first
  workflow that catches them.
